    "Diagnostic-only, not a headline speed build; first64 windows selected six next-layer pairs, no generalization guarantee.",
    "Single-thread offline CPU numeric cost excludes feature capture, scheduling, victim selection and contention. BF16 native gate snapshot converted exactly into float32; no model mutation.",
    "Prediction uses current-layer normalized MoE activation, not true next-layer activation. True next-router IDs are evaluation labels only.",
